<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property relates an origin concept (tradition or brand-new invention) to the literary constraints it qualifies. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa proprietà collega un concetto di origine (tradizione o invenzione ex novo) alle costrizioni letterarie che qualifica. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is origin of"@en .
